  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "pron.",
      "zh": "没有人；谁也不"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Only you can do such a thing, I’m sure, and "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "nobody"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " else has such an ability."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我敢肯定，只有你能做这样的事情，别人没有这样的能力。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "nobody 是常考单词，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：nobody else does as well as sb. 与 sb. does best 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Nobody else speaks French as well as"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Betty in our school."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Betty "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "speaks French best"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " in our school."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "在我们学校贝蒂的法语没人比得上。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
